## Security
The Composio consumer key (`ck_…`) authenticates the gateway and is sensitive.
Keep it in an env var / CI secret, never in git, and rotate it in the Composio
dashboard if it leaks. Note: a core SDK key (`ak_…`) is a *different* credential
and won't work with this gateway.
